          "at": "2026-11-09T03:33:36.736Z",
          "html": "<p>Fixed:  the guide had it backwards.  Violet is you, and every person;  terracotta, the orange-brown, is Claude and every agent.</p><p>One real leftover:  the \"recommended\" thumbs-up was still violet, though it's Claude's suggestion.  It's terracotta now.</p>",
