          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-09T03:33:46.177Z",
          "html": "<p>Done, in the code too.  These were still ivory and are now violet:  the new item and new option forms, a marked note, the text kept when a page changed under you, and page notes.</p><p>Ivory stays only as the page's ground:  the toolbar, the rail, a comment thread's background, as your One Color Each answer kept it.</p>",
